<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>BGTaskSchedulerPermittedIdentifiers</key>
	<array>
		<string>$(PRODUCT_BUNDLE_IDENTIFIER).transcription.processing</string>
		<string>$(PRODUCT_BUNDLE_IDENTIFIER).transcription.continued.*</string>
	</array>
	<key>CFBundleDevelopmentRegion</key>
	<string>$(DEVELOPMENT_LANGUAGE)</string>
	<key>CFBundleDisplayName</key>
	<string>$(MOMO_APP_DISPLAY_NAME)</string>
	<key>CFBundleExecutable</key>
	<string>$(EXECUTABLE_NAME)</string>
	<key>CFBundleIdentifier</key>
	<string>$(PRODUCT_BUNDLE_IDENTIFIER)</string>
	<key>CFBundleInfoDictionaryVersion</key>
	<string>6.0</string>
	<key>CFBundleLocalizations</key>
	<array>
		<string>en</string>
		<string>zh-Hans</string>
		<string>ja</string>
		<string>ko</string>
	</array>
	<key>CFBundleName</key>
	<string>$(MOMO_APP_DISPLAY_NAME)</string>
	<key>CFBundlePackageType</key>
	<string>APPL</string>
	<key>CFBundleShortVersionString</key>
	<string>$(MARKETING_VERSION)</string>
	<key>CFBundleVersion</key>
	<string>$(CURRENT_PROJECT_VERSION)</string>
	<key>LSSupportsOpeningDocumentsInPlace</key>
	<true/>
	<key>NSAlarmKitUsageDescription</key>
	<string>按你的指令设置和管理 MoMo Agent 闹钟。</string>
	<key>NSAppTransportSecurity</key>
	<dict>
		<key>NSAllowsLocalNetworking</key>
		<true/>
		<key>NSExceptionDomains</key>
		<dict>
			<key>100.64.0.0/10</key>
			<dict>
				<key>NSExceptionAllowsInsecureHTTPLoads</key>
				<true/>
			</dict>
		</dict>
	</dict>
	<key>NSCalendarsFullAccessUsageDescription</key>
	<string>开启后，只读日历事项并同步到你的 Mac，由你选用的 AI 服务回答相关问题；不会修改日历。</string>
	<key>NSCameraUsageDescription</key>
	<string>扫描 Mac 上的配对二维码，或拍摄照片添加到聊天。</string>
	<key>NSHealthShareUsageDescription</key>
	<string>按你的选择读取最近 7 天步数和最新心率，同步到配对的 Mac。回答健康或运动问题时，相关数据会发送到你选用的 AI 服务。</string>
	<key>NSLocalNetworkUsageDescription</key>
	<string>允许通过加密连接直接与附近的 Mac 通信，减少连接延迟。</string>
	<key>NSLocationAlwaysAndWhenInUseUsageDescription</key>
	<string>允许后台接收低功耗的到访报告，保留到达和离开的大致时间。你可以随时停用或清空地点记录。相关片段会发送到你选用的 AI 服务。</string>
	<key>NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription</key>
	<string>在你启用地点上下文后记录手机到访的位置、精度和时间。相关片段会发送到你选用的 AI 服务，与日历和录音一起帮助 MoMo 理解生活事件。</string>
	<key>NSMicrophoneUsageDescription</key>
	<string>点击语音输入时录制声音，在手机上识别为可编辑文字。</string>
	<key>NSRemindersFullAccessUsageDescription</key>
	<string>开启后，只读未完成的提醒事项并同步到你的 Mac，由你选用的 AI 服务回答相关问题；不会修改提醒事项。</string>
	<key>UIBackgroundModes</key>
	<array>
		<string>processing</string>
	</array>
	<key>UIFileSharingEnabled</key>
	<true/>
	<key>UILaunchScreen</key>
	<dict/>
	<key>UISupportedInterfaceOrientations</key>
	<array>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationPortrait</string>
	</array>
	<key>MoMoGmailAuthentication</key>
	<string>userProvided</string>
	<key>MoMoPushEnvironment</key>
	<string>$(MOMO_PUSH_ENVIRONMENT)</string>
</dict>
</plist>
